  "ingredients": [
    "4 boneless pork chops",
    "4 teaspoons butter, softened",
    "4 teaspoons mayonnaise",
    "1 teaspoon seasoned salt",
    "1 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1 teaspoon dried parsley",
    "1 cup shredded sharp Cheddar cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (180 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DatG0EwcZgVYXwMzf9-dVcuaWis=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139299-SimpleTimePorkChops-ddms-4x3-step1-8ce3bae3c7364f71bb5467a81f8604af.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139299/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place pork chops in a baking pan. Spread 1 teaspoon of butter over each chop, then spread 1 teaspoon of mayonnaise on top of butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5ghJ6YzKWvw61EMux19kbm-THDE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139299-SimpleTimePorkChops-ddms-4x3-step3-e5bb08f4674640e589cbda93c65aff0d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139299/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season each chop with seasoning salt, garlic powder, and parsley. Sprinkle 1/4 cup cheese over the top of each chop.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VRpfSSmr8unSo47JOk49hRrk4_Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139299-SimpleTimePorkChops-ddms-4x3-step4-25886f387060430c8b23d0496b66e361.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139299/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until pork is slightly pink in the center, about 35 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 145 degrees F (63 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
